WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.860
Muslims believe the Qur'an is God's word,

2
00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.080
and the first source of their law.

3
00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.070
Some of its rulings are clear.

4
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:08.160
No pork.

5
00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.420
A month of fasting in Ramadan.

6
00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:13.990
Many other verses give
principles, such as justice.

7
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.800
But it never mentions cocaine, a drug
Muslim scholars today rule forbidden.

8
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.670
So how do Muslim scholars know
that cocaine is forbidden?

9
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.890
In this mission, you'll meet
the sources of Islamic law,

10
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.450
starting with scripture and the Sunnah.

11
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.460
Then you'll sort human
actions into five rulings,

12
00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.760
from obligatory to forbidden.

13
00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.890
Your mission: find out how scholars
rule on things the Qur'an never names.
